  "notes": "Drawn from N967AV (2024-04-19, left side), sharing the 2023 scheme's geometry (N965AV, HK-5366). Still on part of the fleet as aircraft wait for repaints; which ones isn't tracked here. Re-checked 2026-11-15 on N967AV itself (not the 2023 scheme's geometry), placed by its doors: the title runs 0.234 to 0.420, lowercase 0.66 of the A; the swoosh starts low at about 0.64 as on the 2023 scheme, and is drawn smooth.",
  "history": "Replaced the cream-fuselage, red-topped scheme in 2013 (Avianca/TACA merger). Superseded by the lowercase 2023 wordmark, applied as aircraft are repainted."
